# hub.Dockerfile's context is the repo root (specs/047 W6: .git gives the
# version); send the builder only what the image is made of
*
!.version
!.git
!csi-spl-api/src/go/spool-hub-api
!csi-spl-api/src/docker/hub-entrypoint.sh
!csi-spl-rdb/src/sql/postgres/spool-hub
!csi-spl-rdb/src/sql/postgres/spool-hub-roles
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
